{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":364287,\"title\":\"Father Figure 2\",\"tagline\":\"Being a father figure never felt so good!\",\"overview\":\"Young girls need a role model, someone older and stronger to help guide them through the confusion of growing up. Sometimes, a relationship between a girl and an older man develops into something more than a positive influence. Sweet Sinner explores the passion between older men and younger girls in the second volume of Father Figure.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/82R8ef7zrnl7Ejlj2iY8kHY7f5Q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mC6QheSm9Ciec8OpvSZv49f9o6r.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":130,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"James Avalon\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":997506,\"name\":\"James Avalon\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/RShB3aY8tyTdT18QdDYrxOBzSy.jpg\"},{\"id\":236030,\"name\":\"Jessie Andrews\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o0c6ikH8EE8UaYjNOAeyZdsFCmi.jpg\"},{\"id\":932319,\"name\":\"Riley Reid\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pyXKYW9NhPs7jemBir9Rfz48oUt.jpg\"},{\"id\":128063,\"name\":\"Katie St. Ives\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yV7obeZvQYgsZlKFqjrtzZWARSz.jpg\"},{\"id\":1043335,\"name\":\"Alyssa Branch\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/An6LmZUVXlBoDu4FcMTBQ3CwhHC.jpg\"},{\"id\":131979,\"name\":\"Marcus London\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2b7W8NnSiMlGNNxNuaTLk6tCmJF.jpg\"},{\"id\":193295,\"name\":\"Jake Jacobs\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lVut5kZ6SARK1LvBiwAcZMdibr0.jpg\"},{\"id\":135581,\"name\":\"Alec Knight\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o3SgYm4goyYwit9WOBMyvclB1dx.jpg\"},{\"id\":71547,\"name\":\"Dale DaBone\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myUfAEQQwC09HoobjX4ugCso3B7.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1241574,\"title\":\"No Good Men\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6iqnhVxe71SO2rXjaAgTlJZnkzp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uP6t1cY1IZhFEk1MS1LU6HyGFXG.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"2021, Afghanistan right before the Taliban’s return. Naru, the only camerawoman at Kabul’s main TV station, struggles to keep custody of her three-year-old son after leaving her serial cheater husband. Convinced no good men exist in her country, Naru is caught off guard when Qodrat, Kabul TV’s most important journalist, gives her a career opportunity. As the two crisscross the city reporting on its last days of freedom, sparks fly and Naru starts to doubt herself: could there actually be a good man out there?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1241855,\"title\":\"The Binding\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ug8HGn59e1LmDh2vnzqWad9c94o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ynoF76z4sbGVUPjjFr6QqZBnrvd.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Binyamin moved to Tel Aviv after coming out as gay and facing the trauma following his brother death for which he feels responsible. Binyamin's life takes turn when his relationship with Avinoam, the pub owner where he works, grows closer.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8272,\"title\":\"The Savages\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nY54gSmTOmSXlQpWDB7DWp4u8a7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2KoLLmYiVTBlTv0GYIJYOjYZ9s5.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sister and brother face the realities of familial responsibility as they begin to care for their ailing father.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2652,\"title\":\"Hard Candy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uHTmlcivbPeclEdmtuQg3zOQWPS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9uYq1A9mx4wvQ8J6OF8BXUntciQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hayley’s a smart, charming teenage girl. Jeff’s a handsome, smooth fashion photographer. An Internet chat, a coffee shop meet-up, an impromptu fashion shoot back at Jeff’s place. Jeff thinks it’s his lucky night. He’s in for a surprise.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8736,\"title\":\"Dikkenek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kqI4z9Hzw2GqwzLpYYGO29xqb7K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/69fxCutDF2geixYUXPawl6DDSpx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jean-Claude is a loud-mouthed, know-it-all and full time boor who is best friends with Stef, a self-styled lady killer who would do better with the fairer sex if he could work up the ambition to wake up in the morning. Stef has decided that he may need some help in finding the woman of his dreams, and embracing loyalty rather than logic he turns to Jean-Claude for advice.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5718,\"title\":\"King of California\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zLoa3oJ83zo9g3mV9LNCHbqO7jH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n0LDZHQJ67GZ3rX68juko8kGgDN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Charlie gets released from an insane asylum and moves in with Miranda, the young daughter he left behind. Charlie believes that there is treasure hidden beneath the local Costco, so he puts together a plan to unearth the loot. By convincing Miranda to quit her job at McDonald's and instead work at the wholesale store, he is able to obtain a key. Although Miranda is skeptical, she helps her father with his irrational quest.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2539,\"title\":\"Spanglish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x3OTaBvjqzhRL53Q39fOoIYqxyO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uXJgpBBOxD21X5Q93bZmjNHHdGA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mexican immigrant and single mother Flor Moreno finds housekeeping work with Deborah and John Clasky, a well-off couple with two children of their own. When Flor admits she can't handle the schedule because of her daughter, Cristina, Deborah decides they should move into the Clasky home. Cultures clash and tensions run high as Flor and the Claskys struggle to share space while raising their children on their own, and very different, terms.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13078,\"title\":\"The Babysitters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nsrNUqGXI95unRKZEu8BJ584xWn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hKHX04i2zQrgZJdxS9UuFsgPUd7.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seventeen-year-old Shirley is a good student who works as a babysitter in order to make money for college. One night Michael, a father Shirley works for, confesses he's unhappy with married life. Shirley has a crush on Michael, and seizes this moment to kiss him. Michael is so happy he presents Shirley with a big tip, which gives her an idea. Shirley plans to make extra money by setting up her teenage friends with other unhappy fathers.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8434,\"title\":\"Summer Things\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/laV4Xo5O1COZefAFPJLFZ28pkYS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/azkp4brPsmzJiyKw5ExkPDrVpWA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two couple of friends, one very rich, the other almost homeless, decide to go on Holiday. Julie, a single mother, joins them too. Once at seaside, it starts a complicate love cross among them that will involve also a transsexual, a jealous brother, a Latin Lover and another nervous stressed couple. Not to mention about the daughter of one of them that is secretly in Chicago with one of her father's employees... At the end of the summer, all of them will join the same party...\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1049574,\"title\":\"Darkness of Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nxlUo0jbVdGfixcZLlfZ66KPaFh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSRA1p4e3laAAJflzdgtqNlx27Y.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Russell Hatch, an Interpol operative who takes on the role of father figure to Jayden, the son of an informant killed in a routine raid gone wrong. Years later, Hatch finds himself protecting Jayden and his grandfather from a group of merciless gangs in an all-out turf war, stopping at nothing to protect Jayden and fight anyone getting in his way.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"59uWyPklsy0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nzSwaS9KcbI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"KxwwtjPZYug\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}